t-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b46af89\" id=\"u1b46af89\">设置 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u9989099e\" id=\"u9989099e\">query</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3cdaa905\" id=\"u3cdaa905\"> 输入参数，在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8bc830ce\" id=\"u8bc830ce\">参数值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf01958aa\" id=\"uf01958aa\">区域选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueab17282\" id=\"ueab17282\">引用 Start &gt; user_query</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2cc83a1c\" id=\"u2cc83a1c\">。其他参数项保持默认配置。 </span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"udfd9cdab\" id=\"udfd9cdab\"><td data-lake-id=\"ue008635a\" id=\"ue008635a\"><p data-lake-id=\"u81e589cf\" id=\"u81e589cf\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua719f33d\" id=\"ua719f33d\">代码 </span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uf0b20571\" id=\"uf0b20571\"><ol list=\"u68eec371\"><li fid=\"u3e6d7515\" data-lake-id=\"uea670b34\" id=\"uea670b34\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5dc1207d\" id=\"u5dc1207d\">新增 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ubfa9609b\" id=\"ubfa9609b\">input</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0f6f42cf\" id=\"u0f6f42cf\"> 输入参数，在参数值区域选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u462f182d\" id=\"u462f182d\">引用 bingWebSearch &gt; response_for_model</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88afe7ab\" id=\"u88afe7ab\">。 </span></li><li fid=\"u3e6d7515\" data-lake-id=\"uabf47ac0\" id=\"uabf47ac0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7943d336\" id=\"u7943d336\">在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua7abbe2f\" id=\"ua7abbe2f\">代码</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7d6e9f2a\" id=\"u7d6e9f2a\">区域进入 IDE，将默认代码替换为如下代码，该代码用于提取搜索结果的第一个链接。 </span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22async%20function%20main(%7B%20params%20%7D%3A%20Args)%3A%20Promise%3COutput%3E%20%7B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20parsedData%20%3D%20JSON.parse(params.input)%3B%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20(let%20i%20%3D%200%3B%20i%20%3C%20parsedData.length%3B%20i%2B%2B)%20%7B%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20const