7\">引用 Code &gt; output</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub7c34192\" id=\"ub7c34192\">。其他参数项保持默认配置。 </span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u5d145e0d\" id=\"u5d145e0d\"><td data-lake-id=\"u2c30aa0b\" id=\"u2c30aa0b\"><p data-lake-id=\"udf68dbe0\" id=\"udf68dbe0\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5601c35\" id=\"ue5601c35\">结束 </span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u6fd751a5\" id=\"u6fd751a5\"><p data-lake-id=\"u82be34bf\" id=\"u82be34bf\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u26e5f4e6\" id=\"u26e5f4e6\">新增以下</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2531548c\" id=\"u2531548c\" style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38)\">输出</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1598bef0\" id=\"u1598bef0\">参数： </span></p><ol list=\"uf8280429\"><li fid=\"ue36dbe32\" data-lake-id=\"u3ee672a1\" id=\"u3ee672a1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u831efe6f\" id=\"u831efe6f\">新增 first_link 输出参数，在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3762d11b\" id=\"u3762d11b\">参数值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u476594ce\" id=\"u476594ce\">区域选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub2a49ef9\" id=\"ub2a49ef9\">引用 Code &gt; output</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u58639ba7\" id=\"u58639ba7\">。该参数用于输出网页链接。 </span></li><li fid=\"ue36dbe32\" data-lake-id=\"u703c9e3c\" id=\"u703c9e3c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc1e4f7f7\" id=\"uc1e4f7f7\">新增 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ua95e0680\" id=\"ua95e0680\">first_link_content</span><span data-lake-id=\"u41df50c2\" id=\"u41df50c2\"> 输入参数，在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua6b1034e\" id=\"ua6b1034e\">参数值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue945cfdc\" id=\"ue945cfdc\">区域选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6a985aad\" id=\"u6a985aad\">引用 LinkReaderPlugin &gt; data</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8fd4a67f\" id=\"u8fd4a67f\">。该参数用于获取网页链接的内容。 </span></li><li fid=\"ue36dbe32\" data-lake-id=\"u9fae144f\" id=\"u9fae144f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46f1b2bf\" id=\"u46f1b2bf\">新增 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ue55cfec1\" id=\"ue55cfec1\">search_result</span><span data-lake-id=\"u99ae5c38\" id=\"u99ae5c38\"> 输入参数，在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u74e18a42\" id=\"u74e18a42\">参数值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0b5e9e28\" id=\"u0b5e9e28\">区域</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uab05eba6\" id=\"uab05eba6\">引用 LinkReaderPlugin &gt; response_for_model</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5df281c6\" id=\"u5df281c6\">。该参数用于获取搜索结果。 </span></li></ol></td></tr></tbody></table><ol list=\"u927a6f05\" start=\"9\"><li fid=\"uce844ace\" data-lake-id=\"u9a2d7872\" id=\"u9a2d7872\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc1aebac\" id=\"ubc1aebac\">配置完成后，单击页面右上角的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1aff90a6\" id=\"u1aff90a6\">试运行</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u76455d57\" id=\"u76455d57\">，测试工作流。 </span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u753935ea\" id=\"u753935ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45b999bd\" id=\"u45b999bd\">例如，输入 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u604deeec\" id=\"u604deeec\">了解 AI</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7e10bbc6\" id=\"u7e10bbc6\"> 进行测试，待所有节点都运行成功（节点会展示绿色边框）后，查看指定节点的运行结果。 </span></p><ol list=\"u927a6f05\" start=\"10\"><li fid=\"uce844ace\" data-lake-id=\"u131e7aed\" id=\"u131e7aed\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61f6aa43\" id=\"u61f6aa43\">测试工作流无问题后，单击页面右上角的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua9fc58f0\" id=\"ua9fc58f0\">发布</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufe1aaad3\" id=\"ufe1aaad3\">。 </span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ufe9daa0f\" id=\"ufe9daa0f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uac891ccf\" id=\"uac891ccf\">成功发布后，在工作流列表中可以查看到该工作流。 </span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"8181f1bb\" id=\"8181f1bb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u82697f3a\" id=\"u82697f3a\">步骤二：在智能体添加工作流并测试 </span></h2><ol list=\"ufad58fbd\"><li fid=\"u0aea25de\" data-lake-id=\"u9824e6c8\" id=\"u9824e6c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube56c4c5\" id=\"ube56c4c5\">前往当前团队的智能体页面，创建或进入指定智能体。 </span></li><li fid=\"u0aea25de\" data-lake-id=\"u09dd7b50\" id=\"u09dd7b50\"><span data-lake-id=\"ued8bf845\" id=\"ued8bf845\">在智能体编排页面，找到</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc04a671b\" id=\"uc04a671b\">技能</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u32067f92\" id=\"u32067f92\">区域的工作流，在右侧单击加号图标。 </span></li><li fid=\"u0aea25de\" data-lake-id=\"uf0bbb819\" id=\"uf0bbb819\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c01fd5e\" id=\"u9c01fd5e\">在对话框左侧单击</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u957dead1\" id=\"u957dead1\">团队工作流</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7948f99a\" id=\"u7948f99a\">，找到自建的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7920aa76\" id=\"u7920aa76\">handle_search_tasks</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc8e2cf31\" id=\"uc8e2cf31\"> 工作流，并在右侧单击</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub33b4513\" id=\"ub33b4513\">添加</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ued725852\" id=\"ued725852\">。 </span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u0fe2794f\" id=\"u0fe2794f\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1744192641962-e4de3684-99df-4c7e-95de-4d7db7cef9cc.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4b603df6-abe9-4338-9fcd-fa68adfaacb%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8fb06c00-807c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A594%2C%22height%22%3A327%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2254%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1242%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.6500000953674316%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANDLE_SEARCH_TASKS%E5%BF%83%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A606%2C%22y%22%3A710%2C%22width%22%3A421%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DOUDOC%7C%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E4%BA%8E2024-01-29%22%2C%22x%22%3A618%2C%22y%22%3A881%2C%22width%22%3A387%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%22%2C%22x%22%3A605%2C%22y%22%3A759%2C%22width%22%3A430%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%